<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Payment Failed</title>

    <style>
        :root {
            --dark-bg: #ffffff;
            --accent-orange: #ff8c42;
            --secondary-bg: #0A2E36;
            --text-primary: #ffffff;
            --text-secondary: #cccccc;
        }

        .failed-container {
            min-height: 100vh;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            background: #f8f9fa;
            padding: 2rem;
        }

        .failed-box {
            background: white;
            border: 1px solid #dee2e6;
            padding: 3rem;
            border-radius: 16px;
            text-align: center;
            max-width: 600px;
            width: 100%;
            box-shadow: 0 12px 24px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
        }

        .failed-icon {
            width: 80px;
            height: 80px;
            margin: 0 auto 2rem;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            border-radius: 50%;
            background: rgba(220, 53, 69, 0.1);
            border: 2px solid #dc3545;
        }

        .failed-icon svg {
            width: 40px;
            height: 40px;
            color: #dc3545;
        }

        .failed-title {
            font-size: 2rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            color: #dc3545;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
        }

        .failed-text {
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            color: #6c757d;
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
        }

        .btn-group {
            display: flex;
            gap: 1rem;
            justify-content: center;
            margin-top: 2rem;
        }

        .retry-btn {
            background: #F28123;
            color: white;
            padding: 0.8rem 2rem;
            border-radius: 8px;
            font-weight: 600;
            text-decoration: none;
            transition: all 0.3s;
        }

        .orders-btn {
            background: #343a40;
            color: white;
            padding: 0.8rem 2rem;
            border-radius: 8px;
            font-weight: 600;
            text-decoration: none;
            transition: all 0.3s;
        }

        .retry-btn:hover,
        .orders-btn:hover {
            opacity: 0.9;
            transform: translateY(-2px);
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>

    <div class="failed-container">
        <div class="failed-box">
            <div class="failed-icon">
                <svg fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                    xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                    <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M6 18L18 6M6 6l12 12" />
                </svg>
            </div>

            <h2 class="failed-title">Payment Failed!</h2>
            <p class="failed-text">We couldn't process your payment. Don't worry, your order has been saved and you can
                retry the payment from your order history.</p>

            <div class="btn-group">
                <a href="/orders" class="orders-btn">Go to Orders</a>
                <a href="/checkout" class="retry-btn">Try Again</a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

</body>

</html>